/// The coverage payload: a `(CELL_COUNT + 1)`-entry little-endian
/// `u32` offset table followed by one independently compressed block per
/// glyph. Decoded bitmaps are [`BYTES_PER_GLYPH`] bytes in range order:
/// row major, two 4-bit pixels per byte, left pixel in the high nibble,
/// `0` transparent through `15` fully covered.
pub static COVERAGE: &[u8] = include_bytes!("atlas_coverage.bin");
